 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t one objectively “best” title company, but **Palm Title** looks like a solid Fort Lauderdale option based on the available information: it has a local office, handles residential closings, and its site includes positive customer comments about smooth, communicative closings.\n\n**Palm Title Partners, LLC**  \n100 NE 3rd Avenue, Suite 610, Fort Lauderdale, FL 33301  \n(954) 824-9920 · [palmtitle.com](https://palmtitle.com/)\n\nI’d also compare **Heritage Title Insurance Agency** and **Independent Title of Fort Lauderdale**. Before choosing, ask each for a written estimate of fees, who will handle your file, how they’ll communicate updates, and whether they can meet your closing timeline. Your purchase contract may also specify who selects the closing agent, so check that first.",
